# Neon Courier — Supabase environment template
#
# 👉 Full guide: SUPABASE.md (concepts, schema, RLS, setup, free-tier limits).
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in from:
#   Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are INLINED INTO THE BROWSER BUNDLE by Next.js.
# That is why only the two *public* values carry the prefix — the anon key is
# designed to be public: it is useless without the Row Level Security policies
# in supabase/migrations/. The service-role key below must NEVER get a
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix and must NEVER be imported by client components.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# Server-only credential. Bypasses RLS entirely — used exclusively by
# src/lib/supabase/service.ts inside the /api/scores Route Handler (Node
# runtime). tests/unit/security.test.ts fails the build if any other module
# references it.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-secret-key
